456 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 293 0 R/E(The National Induction Seminar \(NIS\) is AIESEC in Tanzania\220s official onboarding experience for newly recruited members across all branches. Serving as a unifying platform, NIS introduces new members to AIESEC\220s values, structure, and culture while building excitement and alignment for the journey ahead. This term\220s NIS brought together participants from all 7 entities\2045 full Local Committees \(UDSM, UDOM, KLM, MZUMBE, SAUT\) and 2 expansions \(IFM, IAA\)\204marking a strong start to our national recruitment efforts)/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

