<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 298 0 R/T(The East Africa AIESEC Alumni Conference 2024 was successfully held from October 31st to November 3rd, 2024, at the Zanzibar Ocean View Hotel, Stone Town, Zanzibar. This landmark event brought together alumni from across East Africa under the theme "Building Bridges, Empowering Futures." The goal was to foster collaboration, knowledge-sharing, and collective action toward socio-economic development and Pan-African unity. )/E(The East Africa AIESEC Alumni Conference 2024 was successfully held from October 31st to November 3rd, 2024, at the Zanzibar Ocean View Hotel, Stone Town, Zanzibar. This landmark event brought together alumni from across East Africa under the theme "Building Bridges, Empowering Futures." The goal was to foster collaboration, knowledge-sharing, and collective action toward socio-economic development and Pan-African unity. )/Pg 22 0 R/K[6]>>
